<title>SPAIN: Spain Dec currency reserves rose 1.642 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain Dec currency reserves rose 1.642 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars):</p>
<p> RESERVES		     DEC 96     NOV 96     DEC 95</p>
<p> Rise in month	     1,641.8    2,324.3	364.7</p>
<p> End-month total	  61,828.4   60,186.6    38,233.1</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
